OL,3,GNEWSAConservatives challenge government
OL,4,Aestate donation
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal Conservatives have challenged the
OL,7,Fgovernment's #1.9m donation to help
OL,8,Fconservation groups buy a vast upland
OL,9,Festate.
OL,11,FThe Wildlife Trusts and Northumberland
OL,12,FWildlife Trust are raising #30m to
OL,13,Facquire the 9,500-acre Rothbury Estate
OL,14,Fin its entirety as part of plans to
OL,15,Fboost wildlife, restore bogs and
OL,16,Fpromote nature-friendly farming.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
