OL,3,GNEWSAConservatives challenge government
OL,4,Aestate donation
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut as the groups close in on the
OL,7,Ftarget, chairman of Northumberland
OL,8,FConservatives, Guy Renner-Thompson,
OL,9,Fsaid the Department for Environment,
OL,10,FFood and Rural Affairs (Defra) should
OL,11,Finstead focus its support on "our
OL,12,Ffarmers and fishermen".
OL,14,FNature minister Jenny Riddell-Carpenter
OL,15,Fsaid purchase of the site would benefit
OL,16,Flocal communities.
